of 500 miles per hour.

399
00:28:10.280 --> 00:28:11.382
My system's too weak.

400
00:28:11.448 --> 00:28:14.149
I don't have enough energy to fly. /
Mr. Shepard! Come with me!

401
00:28:14.250 --> 00:28:18.454
